<div class="controls">
  <fieldset class="switch">
    <legend>Clavier</legend>
    <div class="options">
      <% boards.each_with_index do |board, index| %>
        <%= tag.input type: "radio", name: "board", id: "board-#{board.id}", checked: index.zero? %>
        <%= label_tag "board-#{board.id}", board_shape(board) %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset class="switch">
    <legend>Verr. num.</legend>
    <div class="options">
      <%= tag.input type: "radio", name: "mode", id: "mode-accents", checked: true, data: { tester_target: "accents", action: "tester#repaint" } %>
      <%= label_tag "mode-accents", safe_join([ "Français", tag.span("allumé, accents en direct", class: "sub") ]) %>
      <%= tag.input type: "radio", name: "mode", id: "mode-digits", data: { tester_target: "digits", action: "tester#repaint" } %>
      <%= label_tag "mode-digits", safe_join([ "Anglais et code", tag.span("éteint, chiffres en direct", class: "sub") ]) %>
    </div>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset class="switch">
    <legend>Affichage</legend>
    <div class="options">
      <%= tag.input type: "checkbox", id: "diff", checked: true %>
      <%= label_tag "diff", "Griser ce qui ne change pas" %>
      <%= tag.input type: "checkbox", id: "fourth" %>
      <%= label_tag "fourth", "AltGr + Maj" %>
    </div>
  </fieldset>
</div>

<figure class="stage">
  <% boards.each do |board| %>
    <%= render "keyboards/board", board: board, keys: keys_of(board), diff: true %>
  <% end %>
</figure>

<p class="legend">
  <span><b class="altgr">é</b> AltGr</span>
  <span class="fourth"><b class="altgr">É</b> AltGr + Maj, en haut à droite</span>
  <span><b class="dead">&#9676;&#769;</b> touche morte</span>
  <span class="diff"><b class="same">a</b> comme sur l'AZERTY</span>
</p>

<p class="mode-note">
  <b>Verr. num. choisit la langue.</b> Allumé, la rangée du haut porte les accents et les chiffres sont sur Maj.
  Éteint, les chiffres passent en direct et les accents sur Maj, rien d'autre ne bouge.
  <kbd>Maj</kbd> + <kbd>Verr. maj.</kbd> bascule, comme la touche Verr. num. d'un clavier externe.
</p>
